{"_id":"6970bf09ca65159dd20a7d23","roadmapSlug":"mlops","nodeId":"93MPXEulKgPnuRlp7F-Nj","description":"# MLflow\n\nMLflow is an open-source platform designed to manage the complete machine learning lifecycle. It provides tools for tracking experiments, packaging code into reproducible runs, and deploying models to various platforms. MLflow helps data scientists and engineers streamline their workflows, collaborate effectively, and ensure the reliability of their machine learning projects.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"MLFlow","url":"https://mlflow.org/","_id":"6a7f4ad2cb44947debcfa5c1"},{"type":"official","title":"MLFlow Docs","url":"https://mlflow.org/docs/latest/","_id":"6a7f4ad2cb44947debcfa5c2"},{"type":"opensource","title":"mlflow","url":"https://github.com/mlflow/mlflow","_id":"6a7f4ad2cb44947debcfa5c3"},{"type":"article","title":"Streamline Your Machine Learning Workflow with MLFlow","url":"https://www.datacamp.com/tutorial/mlflow-streamline-machine-learning-workflow","_id":"6a7f4ad2cb44947debcfa5c4"},{"type":"article","title":"Comprehensive Guide to MlFlow","url":"https://towardsdatascience.com/comprehensive-guide-to-mlflow-b84086b002ae/?utm_source=roadmap&utm_medium=Referral&utm_campaign=TDS+roadmap+integration","_id":"6a7f4ad2cb44947debcfa5c5"},{"type":"video","title":"MLFlow Tutorial | ML Ops Tutorial","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6ngxBkx05Fs","_id":"6a7f4ad2cb44947debcfa5c6"},{"type":"video","title":"MLflow for Machine Learning Development - Video Introduction","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5pPflDSdFLg&list=PLQqR_3C2fhUUOmaeowgv4WquvH515zVmo","_id":"6a7f4ad2cb44947debcfa5c7"}],"createdAt":"2026-01-21T11:56:57.510Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:05:22.994Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d04168aa","title":"DataCamp - MLOps Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/L0Ynzo"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/